IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `nsw-wc-core`
IMPORT `nsw-wc-seat`

-- Cases for the injured worker's seat (nsw-wc-seat.l4) and the regulative rules of nsw-wc-core.l4 that the worker is a
-- party to (1998 Act ss 44, 261, 48A, 49). Every expected value was worked by hand from the deposited texts
-- (act-1987-070.txt, act-1998-086.txt, sl-2016-0559.txt), with the arithmetic in a comment, never copied from the
-- encoding's output. HYPOTHETICAL throughout: no scenario life raises these Acts. The amounts are the figures the
-- deposited texts state, which are out of date; none is the figure for 2026.
--
-- A breached or still-pending DEONTIC cannot be asserted on the stable l4, so regulative rules are asserted where the
-- trace ends FULFILLED, and #TRACEd with an "-- expect:" line where it does not.

