#ASSERT `For how long will my medical expenses be paid` `1 Jan 2018` `not set apart` `other treatment, service or assistance` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE `10 Apr 2024` `31 Dec 2025` EQUALS `the medical compensation period is not covered` `the injury was received before 21 October 2019: Regulation Part 3 and the Schedule 6 transitional provisions apply, which this encoding does not cover`

