#ASSERT `What lump sum is payable for my permanent impairment` `1 Mar 2024` `not set apart` 12 100 FALSE NOTHING EQUALS `permanent impairment compensation is not covered` `the s 66(2)(a) and (b) amounts for more than 10% and not more than 50% are formulas that are missing from the deposited text`
